# Lane C files

Follow `.agents/skills/lane-c-agent/SKILL.md`.

- Four Steel functions: start, navigate, content, stop. Both timeout flags. `timeout=` on every `subprocess.run`. Errors include stdout.
- Emit `FRONTEND.md` §6.1 events. SSE replays the full log on connect. Bind `127.0.0.1`.
- Do not hard-check `STEEL_API_KEY`. Never put `connect_url` on screen. Never recreate a session inside `POST /go`.
- Do not create `display.py`. Delete the stdin-daemon human-finish thread.
